      "message": "Couple potential problematic scenarios:\n\n1. ANGLE gn arg `angle_libs_suffix` set to `_angle_in_apk`, `debug.angle.libs.suffix` is not set. lib*angle.so in system partition is loaded.\n\n2. ANGLE gn arg `angle_libs_suffix` is not set. `debug.angle.libs.suffix` is set to `angle_in_apk`. Loader fails to find `lib*_angle_in_apk.so` and will crash.\n\n3. ANGLE gn arg `angle_libs_suffix` is not set. `debug.angle.libs.suffix` is not set. lib*angle.so in system partition is loaded.\n\nIs my understanding correct?\n\nWould you please update the readme https://chromium.googlesource.com/angle/angle/+/HEAD/doc/DevSetupAndroid.md#building-the-angle-apk with a section on how to side-load angle apk on SkiaGL-based devices?",
